    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n* Property being sold with furniture included*\n\nSituated in the heart of Kilrush, this three-bedroom mid-terrace residence offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a home within walking distance of every town amenity, being located just a two-minute stroll from Kilrush Marina and the town centre.\n\nExtending to approximately 75.20 sq. m. (809 sq. ft.), the property has oil fired central heating and is connected to mains water and mains sewerage. The accommodation comprises of an entrance hallway, a comfortable reception room with a solid fuel fireplace, a fitted kitchen/dining room, a fully tiled ground floor shower room and a ground floor bedroom / office. Upstairs, there are two further double bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes, together with the main bathroom. The property is being sold with furniture included. \n\nTo the front, the property is accessed via a gated pedestrian entrance with the enclosed rear garden featuring a lawn, a covered pergola seating area and a block built garage. \n\nViewing is highly recommended of this centrally located home with prior appointment with sole selling agents. PSL002295"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nFront Hallway - 2.9m x 1.9m\nTimber style flooring, carpeted staircase leading to first floor landing, wall mounted mirror, door to main reception and bedroom one.\n\nMain Reception - 4.55m x 3.35m\nCarpeted flooring, fireplace with back boiler, tile surround and tile flag with solid fuel inset with ceiling to floor timber panelling and overhead wall mounted lighting, built-in storage to one side of the fireplace and alcove to the other, door to understairs storage and double doors leading to kitchen dining.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 6.65m x 3.2m\nTimber style flooring, rear aspect window, sky well, built-in wall and base units with ample work surfaces, tile splash back, one and a half bowl single drainer sink with mixer tap, integrated appliances including oven, ceramic hob, extractor hood and fan, freestanding fridge and washing machine (included in the sale price) and door to shower room.\n\nShower Room - 2.4m x 1.35m\nFully tiled ceiling to floor, low level wc, wash hand basin and corner electric shower unit with glass shower door.\n\nBedroom One / Office - 2.9m x 2.55m\nTimber style flooring, front aspect window and painted timber panel ceiling.\n\nFirst Floor Landing - \nCarpeted flooring and doors to main bathroom and bedrooms two and three.\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.55m x 1.65m\nTile flooring, rear aspect window, timber panelling to the ceiling, decorative wallpaper and timber panelling to the walls, low level wc, wash hand basin with base vanity and overhead wall mounted cabinet.\n\nBedroom Two - 3.5m x 2.9m\nTimber style flooring, rear aspect window, built-in wardrobes and houses hot press.\n\nBedroom Three - 3.55m x 2.8m\nTimber style flooring, front aspect window, painted timber panelling to the ceiling and built-in wardrobes with ample hanging rails and storage.\n\nGarage - 4m x 3.5m\nBlock built, concrete flooring and houses oil burner.\n\nOutside - \nFront - Block wall boundaries to front and sides , gated pedestrian access, footpath leading to front door, lawn area to one side and pea gravel to the other side. Rear - Covered pagoda area, footpath leading to detached garage and rear access to laneway at the back of the houses, lawn area, mature shrubs and high timber boundaries to the sides.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Eircode V15CT93</li><li> Total Floor Space 75.20 Square Meters</li><li> Built 1950</li><li> Property Being Sold with Furniture</li><li> Oil Fired Central Heating, Fireplace with Back Boiler</li><li> Mains Water, Mains Sewage</li><li> On Street Parking</li><li> Enclosed Rear Garden with seperate access, Block Built Garage</li><li> Town Centre Location, Marina 2 Min Walk</li><li> Walking Distance to all Town Amenities</ul>"
      },
